message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the following metadata."
title: "PiXY: Pixel to stage-XY Coordinate Converter"
version: "1.4.1"
url: "https://github.com/YoshiakiKON/PiXY"
repository-code: "https://github.com/YoshiakiKON/PiXY"
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.18174474
repository-artifact: "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.18174474"
authors:
  - family-names: "Kon"
    given-names: "Yoshiaki"
    affiliation: "Geological Survey of Japan, AIST"
date-released: 2026-06-08
license: "MIT"
abstract: >
  PiXY is open-source software that links target selection on microscopy images with physical
  positioning on an analytical instrument stage by converting image (pixel) coordinates into
  stage coordinates using user-defined fiducial points.

